            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan variabel <code>breed</code> ke class dan tetapkan string \"tabby\" padanya.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Virtual_Pet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Whiskers&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  breed = \" /><text value=\"&quot;tabby&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"cat = Virtual_Pet()\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>breed</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"tabby\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan variabel <code>breed</code> ke class dan tetapkan string \"tabby\" padanya.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Virtual_Pet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Whiskers&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  breed = \" /><text value=\"&quot;tabby&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"cat = Virtual_Pet()\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"name\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>breed</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"tabby\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
